---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Callout from "@dst/ui/Callout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Money: Crypto Near Riviera"
  description="Where Riviera residents actually handle crypto — nearby exchange options and how buying Dubai property with crypto works in practice."
>
  <section class="container hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Money</p>
    <h1>Crypto, close to home</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Dubai's crypto exchange scene is concentrated a short drive from
      Riviera rather than inside the development itself — this page is
      about getting there efficiently, not pretending there's an exchanger
      on the promenade.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Nearest exchange options</h2>
    <p>
      Licensed crypto exchange desks and ATMs cluster in Business Bay, DIFC,
      and Downtown — all within a 15–20 minute drive of Riviera given its
      MBR City location. That's close enough to treat as routine rather than
      a special trip, which is the main practical point: you don't need to
      be based in DIFC to have convenient access to it.
    </p>
    <p>
      As with any crypto service, verify current licensing (VARA-regulated
      in Dubai) directly before using a specific exchange or ATM — provider
      details change more often than this page is updated.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <h2>Buying property with crypto</h2>
    <p>
      A growing number of Dubai developers and brokerages accept crypto for
      property purchases, usually via a licensed conversion step at the
      point of transaction rather than a developer directly holding crypto.
      If you're specifically looking at Riviera or a comparable development
      with crypto as the funding source, that's a conversation to have with
      the brokerage handling the unit before assuming it's supported.
    </p>
  </section>

  <Callout>
    DST's crypto vertical covers this in more depth network-wide — regulation,
    where to exchange, and the buy-with-crypto process — as a dedicated site.
    This page is the Riviera-specific summary of that broader coverage.
  </Callout>
</Layout>

